<title>USA: Disney Online to charge for kid website-NYT.</title>
<headline>Disney Online to charge for kid website-NYT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walt Disney Co plans to charge $4.95 per month for access to its new Internet web site for children, the New York Times said on Monday.</p>
<p>The site, called Disney Daily Blast, will feature an ABC News report for children and sports scores as well as puzzles and stories, the paper said.</p>
<p>New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
